          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "The file sets no limits.maxOrderValue, so one order can lock any amount in the escrow. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in the pages it cites. Fix: Set limits.maxOrderValue with its token, at the largest order the marketplace means to hold."
