          "message": {
            "text": "The upgrader of the escrow, 0x6666666666666666666666666666666666666666, is not a timelock, and the roles name none, so an upgrade takes effect at once and users cannot leave first. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in the pages it cites. Fix: Name a timelock in roles.timelock and make it the upgrader, or keep upgrades immediate on purpose and say so."
